In <1993Jun24.120718.22057@mlb.semi.harris.com> jdl@cip250.corp.harris.com (John Little) writes:
>Here is my embarassing newbie question:
>How do I find the stairs to level 2 (yes, that's right, 2)?  I have searched multiple level 1's, but I can't find the down level or up level symbols.  I know
>that you have to search multiple times to find some hidden doors, but I have beenrepeatedly searching the same level one now for 2 days.  Please meail me you
>response!

It would seem that someone is pulling a trick on you.  It looks like
they have changed the symbols for up and down stairs (< and >
respectivly) to be the same as the floor symbol (usually .).  There
are a number of ways to fix this, mostly invlolving the GRAPHICS= line
in nethack.cnf (pc version) or something similar in the HACKOPTIONS
environment variable.  See the documentation for more detail.

Of course, I could be wrong.  One hint is that when you first appear
in the dungeon, you are always on the up stairs.  Look (press ':') to
see what's actually on the spot where you're standing.

